        {
          "title": "美",
          "content": "<p>国宾州大学发布了一个演示，监视<a href=\"https://www.psu.edu/news/engineering/story/conversations-remotely-detected-cell-phone-vibrations-researchers-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">手机通话时的微小震动</a>，可以还原出通话内容。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202508/bg2025081102.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>手机通话时，扬声器会震动，通过激光雷达，在3米外监视手机，可以感受到这种震动，从而还原出语音。</p>\n<p>再通过 Whisper 模型，将语音转成文字，就能得到通话内容，准确率为60%。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "手机通话时的微小震动",
              "url": "https://www.psu.edu/news/engineering/story/conversations-remotely-detected-cell-phone-vibrations-researchers-report"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
